cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite the SALRM software package. After publication, please also cite the associated paper."
title: "SALRM Reproducibility Package"
type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Kim"
    given-names: "Jin"
    affiliation: "Sangmyung University"
    https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9632-5672

abstract: >-
  This repository provides the implementation, configuration, environment
  records, integrity metadata, and analysis artifacts for the
  Sensitivity-Aware Latent Reliability Model (SALRM), a framework for
  evaluating large language models across multidimensional benchmarks while
  accounting for item difficulty, intervention sensitivity, and estimation
  uncertainty.

keywords:
  - large language models
  - reliability assessment
  - sensitivity analysis
  - latent variable model
  - uncertainty quantification
  - reproducibility

repository-code: "https://github.com/jinny14/salrm-reproducibility"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-16"
license: MIT